1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 16=

34
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,360
What can I do for you, Arhat?

35
00:01:59,640 --> 00:01:59,960
Well...

36
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,040
Here's the thing.

37
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,520
Lately,

38
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:02,640
a water monster

39
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,560
has been poisoning people.

40
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,160
You're in charge around here,

41
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,720
so we were hoping you could help.

42
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,800
What kind of poison did it use?

43
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,360
I might recognize it.

44
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,240
Hey!

45
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:13,680
Stop swooning over him.

46
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,000
Give him the rouge.

47
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:17,960
Oh no!

48
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,480
I left it at the yamen.

49
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,080
Uh...

50
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,440
If we go get it now,

51
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,320
we might still make it.

52
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,280
No way.

53
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,800
Erlang Shen is at the yamen.

54
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,720
The Ke Residence might have some.

55
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:30,840
Then let's not waste any time.

56
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,120
Let's head to the Ke Residence.

57
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,840
Okay.

58
00:02:38,363 --> 00:02:39,703
(Ke Residence)

59
00:02:40,661 --> 00:02:42,948
(Virtue Brings Honor)

60
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,040
Wake up!

61
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,040
Come on, wake up!

62
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,240
Ugh...

63
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,800
I'm not going to make it.

64
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:51,280
You can't die on me!

65
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,680
If you die,

66
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,520
how will I save my benefactor?

67
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,600
I have no choice.

68
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,200
Benefactor,

69
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,120
to save you,

70
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,840
I'll have to sacrifice my first kiss.

71
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,200
You...

72
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,440
What are you doing?

73
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,440
You're finally awake!

74
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,320
What happened?

75
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,800
Was I asleep for long?

76
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:22,920
Where's Shen Lang?

77
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,800
He...

78
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,440
(I can't let her know the truth.)

79
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,080
(If their relationship falls apart)

80
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:28,600
(and she's left heartbroken,)

81
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,680
(I won't get the devotion I need.)

82
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,680
Oh!

83
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,920
The groom went to see your father.

84
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,829
Before he left, he asked me

85
00:03:36,830 --> 00:03:38,080
to help you get ready.

86
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,600
What happened to your face?

87
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,280
Oh.

88
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,800
I fought a dog over food last night

89
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,640
and got bitten.

90
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,200
Oh...

91
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,400
Something's in my stomach.

92
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,680
It hurts.

93
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,480
You must be pregnant.

94
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,800
Really?

95
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,600
Ah!

96
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,440
Shen Lang was pretty rough with me.

97
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,320
He's young

98
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,400
and full of passion.

99
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,520
It's only natural.

100
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,440
Good morning!

101
00:04:10,286 --> 00:04:10,747
Oh!

102
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,800
I'm glad you're okay, Ms. Ke.

103
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,720
It's just a shame

104
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,480
Shen Lang got away.

105
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,520
What happened to Shen Lang?

106
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,360
Your groom is a monster!

107
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,500
If we hadn't

108
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:22,240
arrived in time last night,

109
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,240
he would've killed you!

110
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,720
What?

111
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,680
Hey, hey!

112
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:29,680
What...

113
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,120
Oh no!

114
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,560
Hey!

115
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,840
Look what you did!

116
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,160
I finally got her awake,

117
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,760
and you scared her unconscious!

118
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:40,560
Here's the plan.

119
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:42,240
I'll wake her up again.

120
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,600
Then you come back in,

121
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,320
and don't say anything stupid!

122
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,200
Mm.

123
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,240
Go, go, go!

124
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,520
Hurry!

125
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,480
Go, go!

126
00:04:53,487 --> 00:04:54,040
Go!

127
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,560
Hurry up!

128
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,240
Shen Lang...

129
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,120
How could Shen Lang be a monster?

130
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,200
Monster?

131
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,240
What monster?

132
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,160
You must've dreamed that last night.

133
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,640
A dream?

134
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,040
M-My stomach...

135
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:17,840
You're pregnant.

136
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:18,680
You...

137
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,480
Your face...

138
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,040
A dog bit me.

139
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,400
Ah.

140
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,240
My chest...

141
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,040
The groom did that.

142
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:31,720
Morning!

143
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,520
Ms. Ke.

144
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,480
Morning.

145
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,520
You...

146
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,920
Where's Shen Lang?

147
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,840
He went to see your father.

148
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,200
Mm.

149
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,520
How is my father?

150
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,560
Good news.

151
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,480
Shen Lang

152
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,720
gave us

153
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,640
the formula for Rouge Snow.

154
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,120
Before long,

155
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,840
we'll have an antidote.

156
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,520
My lady!

157
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,520
Bad news!

158
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,800
Your father's critically ill!

159
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:57,560
Father!

160
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,640
Hey, hey!

161
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,120
Ms. Ke!

162
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,320
Oh no!

163
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,760
Again.

164
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,120
Father!

165
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,520
How is my father?

166
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,200
Oh!

167
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,640
I have good news.

168
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,280
We

169
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,000
used

170
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,560
the formula Shen Lang gave us

171
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,800
to find the herb used in Rouge Snow.

172
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,480
We'll

173
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,240
have the antidote soon.

174
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,040
My lady!

175
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,520
Did something happen to my father?

176
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,720
(Remember, don't say anything stupid!)

177
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,600
(Don't blurt anything out!)

178
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
No.

179
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,669
We just came to ask

180
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:38,920
what you'd like for breakfast.

181
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,720
- Ah.
- Ah.

182
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,680
The usual is fine.

183
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,840
You can go now.

184
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,720
I need to help her get ready.

185
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,240
Sure, sure.

186
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,520
We won't bother you, then.

187
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,800
Let's go!

188
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,240
Come on!

189
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,280
- Hurry!
- We're leaving!

190
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,520
- Let's get you ready, my lady.
- (Why are they acting so strange?)

191
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,160
Master!

192
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:03,800
Huh?

193
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,280
Mr. Ke is at death's door.

194
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,680
Please save him!

195
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,360
Oh no!

196
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,840
I forgot to ask Ms. Ke

197
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,080
if she had yesterday's rouge.

198
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,840
Rouge Snow?

199
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,080
I do.

200
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:14,480
You do?

201
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,360
Me too.

202
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,360
Mr. Ke gave me two boxes.

203
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,640
I was going to take them home

204
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,240
for my mother when I got the chance.

205
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,320
That's it!

206
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,040
Wait, wait!

207
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,080
Careful!

208
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,480
Human or demon,

209
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,480
anyone who touches it

210
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,800
will lose control

211
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,080
and start biting people.

212
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,280
Soul-Loss Powder.

213
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:32,880
Mm.

214
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:35,080
It's a poison unique to the merfolk.

215
00:07:36,479 --> 00:07:37,279
Oh.

216
00:07:37,513 --> 00:07:38,353
Merfolk?

217
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,480
Why would the merfolk target Mr. Ke?

218
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,600
Why make him

219
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,920
produce such poisonous rouge?

220
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,000
And why

221
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,240
try to kill Ms. Ke

222
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,320
on her wedding night?

223
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,640
Why go to all that trouble?

224
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:49,120
What are they after?

225
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,280
The merfolk are hot-tempered

226
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,080
and elusive.

227
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,480
I know little about them.

228
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,320
But I've heard

229
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,880
Soul-Loss Powder drives people feral

230
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,880
and kills them within seven days.

231
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:01,280
Even immortals can't cure it.

232
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,960
Only a scale from the Merfolk King

233
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,480
can neutralize the poison.

234
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,000
Seven days?

235
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,880
It's been two already.

236
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,520
That means only five days left!

237
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,520
The Merfolk King loves mortal wine.

238
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,680
He built a shrine west of the city.

239
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,960
On the first and fifteenth each month,

240
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,000
he comes ashore for offerings

241
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,920
and drinks his fill.

242
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,120
Oh!

243
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,720
Today's the fifteenth!

244
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,920
Then there's no time to lose.

245
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,800
Arhat, take the two celestial maidens

246
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,080
and subdue the Merfolk King.

247
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,960
Get the antidote.

248
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,640
I'll stay here

249
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,040
in case that merfolk comes back

250
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,080
to harm Ms. Ke.

251
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,080
Huh?

252
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:34,080
J-Just us?

253
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:34,880
Haha...

254
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,920
To tell you the truth,

255
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,320
there was a little mishap.

256
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:39,920
I...

257
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,000
have no spiritual power right now.

258
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,880
That's why I came to you for help.

259
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,400
You have no spiritual power?

260
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,360
Yeah.

261
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,760
But it'll be fine.

262
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,200
He loves to drink, right?

263
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,760
Once we share a drink,

264
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,560
we're all friends.

265
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:51,800
If he still refuses,

266
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,200
then you can step in.

267
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,080
Okay?

268
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,520
All right.

269
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,640
Then we'll go together.

270
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,000
Let's go.

271
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,880
Hey.

272
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,560
When did those two pass out?

273
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,960
Come on, let's go.

274
00:09:07,423 --> 00:09:11,590
(Rice Wine)

275
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,400
That wine smells amazing.

276
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,960
Who are you, monk?

277
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,680
I was passing by

278
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,520
and smelled the wine,

279
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,920
so I came in for a look.

280
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,920
This wine is all mine.

281
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,160
Oh, come on.

282
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,640
Good wine should be shared.

283
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,760
I'm not here to steal your wine.

284
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,440
I'm here to share mine with you.

285
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:37,200
Here, here!

286
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,600
Cheers, my friend!

287
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:45,960
That smells like great wine!

288
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,200
Haha!

289
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,880
This wine isn't for you.

290
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:49,800
Here.

291
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,200
My friend.

292
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,160
Haha.

293
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,080
Monk,

294
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,160
all wine lovers are family.

295
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,400
Two can drink it,

296
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,560
and so can three.

297
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,480
Why be so stingy?

298
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,200
You can't drink this wine.

299
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,880
Just one sip.

300
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:05,800
Only one.

301
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,240
I'm trying to save your life!

302
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,400
Wine is my life!

303
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,040
Ah!

304
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,200
Know your place!

305
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:19,040
How dare you fight my friend
for his wine?

306
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,200
Here.

307
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,000
Wipe it off.

308
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,920
Here.

309
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,880
A toast to you.

310
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,240
Good!

311
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:32,720
That hits the spot!

312
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,560
Monk,

313
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,760
try some of my wine.

314
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,880
Sure, sure!

315
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:36,880
Well...

316
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,640
Since you're enjoying the wine,

317
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:41,000
I was hoping

318
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:43,920
to ask you a favor.

319
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,480
Let's hear it.

320
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:49,560
Could I borrow one of your scales?

321
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:50,280
A scale?

322
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:50,560
Yeah.

323
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,360
What scale?

324
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,840
A scale from the Merfolk King.

325
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:54,960
The Merfolk King?

326
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,640
I'm just Wang from next door.

327
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,120
Huh?

328
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,440
I saw the offering wine

329
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,000
and snuck in to steal some.

330
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,760
You're a wine thief?

331
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:20,000
How dare you drink my wine!

332
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,760
I'll eat you!

333
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,720
Ah!

334
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:31,240
Y-You're the Merfolk King?

335
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,080
You wouldn't drink with me,

336
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,360
and then you hit me!

337
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,880
I'll eat you, too!

338
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,280
Hey!

339
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:38,080
Easy, easy!

340
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,080
Let me

341
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,080
pour you a drink to apologize.

342
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,760
Now that I'm angry,

343
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,640
you finally offer me a drink?

344
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,680
Too late!

345
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,160
Fine.

346
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:47,440
Since you

347
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,840
insist on doing this the hard way,

348
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:52,360
I came prepared.

349
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,280
Hmph.

350
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:59,640
Mm... Mm... Mm...

351
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,640
Little Alligator Dragon!

352
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:04,280
I was at your first-month banquet!

353
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,080
And now you're helping this rotten monk

354
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,080
attack me?

355
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,280
I wouldn't dare.

356
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:12,040
This monk is an Arhat reincarnate.

357
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,760
He has no spiritual power now,

358
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,960
so I brought him as a snack with your wine.

359
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,520
What?

360
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:18,440
Hey, hey!

361
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,920
We agreed to talk before fighting!

362
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,760
This whole deception

363
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,320
wasn't part of the plan!

364
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:25,880
Monk.

365
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:26,160
Huh?

366
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:27,560
Take a good look at me.

367
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,680
- Shen Lang?
- Shen Lang?

368
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:38,950
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

369
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:42,210
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

370
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:46,010
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

371
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:49,040
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

372
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:56,250
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

373
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:59,800
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

374
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:09,710
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

375
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:12,970
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

376
00:13:13,260 --> 00:13:16,280
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

377
00:13:16,290 --> 00:13:17,970
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

378
00:13:18,010 --> 00:13:19,890
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

379
00:13:19,930 --> 00:13:21,450
♪I left my wife behind♪

380
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:23,050
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

381
00:13:23,090 --> 00:13:26,870
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

382
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:28,010
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

383
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,110
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

384
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:31,810
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

385
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:33,680
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

386
00:13:33,710 --> 00:13:37,040
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

387
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:40,310
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

388
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:43,440
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

389
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:46,810
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

390
00:13:46,860 --> 00:13:50,470
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

391
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:53,820
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

392
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:56,930
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

393
00:13:57,510 --> 00:14:00,560
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

394
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:04,000
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

395
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:07,560
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

396
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:11,040
♪You're just wasting your time♪

397
00:14:11,090 --> 00:14:14,010
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

398
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:15,670
♪And I just laugh happily♪

399
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:19,080
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

400
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:31,360
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

401
